---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us - SVG Clean Kit"
  description="Learn about SVG Clean Kit, our mission to make vector assets lightweight and privacy-first, and how we run 100% in-browser."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="py-14 sm:py-20 bg-[var(--color-canvas)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-[var(--color-hairline)] pb-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-link)]"></span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-mute)]">
            Our Mission
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-sans text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] text-[var(--color-ink)] sm:text-4xl">
          About SVG Clean Kit
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-body)]">
          Building the fastest, most respectful SVG optimization suite on the web — engineered for modern web developers and vector designers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Story -->
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-body)]">
        
        <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            Why We Built SVG Clean Kit
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Every day, millions of developers and designers export icons, logos, and UI graphics from tools like <strong>Figma, Adobe Illustrator, Inkscape, and Sketch</strong>. While these design applications are incredible for creative authoring, their SVG exporters inject staggering amounts of bloat: internal editor namespaces, undo histories, author metadata, empty layer groups, and coordinate numbers running up to 9 decimal places.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This extra baggage causes web pages to load slower, degrades Google Core Web Vitals (Largest Contentful Paint and DOM size), and clutters code repositories with thousands of lines of unreadable XML.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Existing web tools either required uploading sensitive artwork to third-party cloud servers, subjected users to intrusive pop-up advertisements, or failed to provide developer exports like React JSX and Data URIs. We built <strong>SVG Clean Kit</strong> to solve every single one of those pain points.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Principles Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6">
            <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded-[6px] bg-[var(--color-hairline-soft)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-3">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Privacy by Default</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Your graphics stay exclusively in your browser memory. We never upload or inspect your files.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6">
            <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded-[6px] bg-[var(--color-hairline-soft)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-3">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m3.75 13.5 10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75Z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Pure Speed</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Sub-millisecond processing powered by modern WebAssembly and client-side JavaScript.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6">
            <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded-[6px] bg-[var(--color-hairline-soft)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-3">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75 22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3-4.5 16.5" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Developer First</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed">
              1-click export to typed React JSX components, Data URIs, and raw minified SVG code.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Stack -->
        <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            Technology Behind SVG Clean Kit
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            SVG Clean Kit is crafted with modern, lightweight web technologies:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li><strong>Astro 5:</strong> Delivers zero-JavaScript static HTML page structure for maximum responsiveness and search engine performance.</li>
            <li><strong>Tailwind CSS v4:</strong> Next-generation styling engine configured with the Vercel Geist design system.</li>
            <li><strong>SVGO (Browser Engine):</strong> The industry standard for lossless SVG path reduction and node minification.</li>
            <li><strong>JSZip:</strong> Asynchronously bundles batches of optimized SVGs directly in browser memory without server hops.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)] flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
        <a href="/" class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium hover:underline">&larr; Back to Optimizer</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="text-[var(--color-body)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]">Get in Touch &rarr;</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
